# NestJS Review Skill

## Muc dich
Review NestJS applications cho correctness, architecture, performance, va security.

## Khi nao dung
- Review NestJS application code
- Audit NestJS modules va dependency injection
- Performance review cho NestJS API
- Security review cho NestJS endpoints

## Review Areas

### Architecture Review
- [ ] Module structure follows NestJS conventions
- [ ] Dependency injection properly scoped
- [ ] Feature modules properly isolated
- [ ] Shared modules for reusable components
- [ ] Core module for app-wide services

### API Review
- [ ] Controllers follow REST conventions
- [ ] DTOs used for validation
- [ ] Pipes used for transformation/validation
- [ ] Guards used for auth/authorization
- [ ] Interceptors used for cross-cutting concerns

### Performance Review
- [ ] Database queries optimized (use TypeORM wisely)
- [ ] Connection pooling configured
- [ ] Response caching implemented
- [ ] Lazy loading for heavy modules
- [ ] N+1 query prevention

### Security Review
- [ ] Input validation with class-validator
- [ ] Auth guards on protected routes
- [ ] Rate limiting configured
- [ ] CORS configured properly
- [ ] No sensitive data in logs or responses

